Xacharus.wikitext:
{{BloodRavensPortal}}
'''Xacharus''' is a forbidding [[Primaris Judiciar]] in the [[Blood Ravens]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
Like all [[Judiciar]]s, Xacharus has taken a vow of silence and uses it to better contemplate his duty to the [[Emperor]]. He is also a lethal executioner, who leads the [[Blood Ravens]]' battle lines with unswerving resolve. Xacharus is now among his [[Chapter]]'s forces,{{Fn|1a}} that are purging the [[Ork]] horde which has overrun the [[Imperium]]'s [[Bastion Theta]] facility.{{Fn|1b}}

