Xagramothis.wikitext:
{{BlackLegionPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Sorcerer]] of the [[Black Legion]]. He is currently one of the primary Chaos warlords remaining in the [[Vigilus]] warzone. He has received orders from [[Abaddon]] directly to continue until victory or destruction.{{Fn|1}}

At Hive Mortwald, {{PAGENAME}} sought to hunt down [[Inquisitor]] [[Cartavolnus]]. However his plan was the appearance of [[Saint Celestine]], and the Sorcerer was forced to summon 3 gigantic [[Daemonhosts]] to confront her. The [[Living Saint]] and her followers were able to defeat the trio and their lesser daemonic hordes, and Celestine went missing in a wave of empyric fire that enveloped the battlefield. {{PAGENAME}}' status after the battle is unknown.{{Fn|2}}

