Xakros'Ka.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Bloodthirster]] of [[Khorne]] who led its [[Daemon]]ic Warband, the [[Brimstone Stampede]], out of the newly created [[Great Rift]] and into the [[Carricus Sector]].{{Fn|1}}

Once there, they rampaged across the [[Sector]] and slaughtered trillions of [[Imperial]] souls. When the [[Grey Knights]] learned of Xakros'Ka's invasion, the [[Chapter]] sent its [[2nd Brotherhood (Grey Knights)|Second Brotherhood]] to stop the Bloodthirster and the Brotherhood then rallied the [[Storm Reapers]] Chapter to their cause. They soon begin a counter-attack and while the Storm Reapers launched lightning assaults into the flank of Xakros'Ka's mighty horde, the sons of Titan struck at its heart. Armed with the Bloodthirster's true name, the Grey Knights destroyed Xakros'Ka's physical form, but the victory came at a hideous cost.{{Fn|1}}

