Xedro Farren.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] in the [[Dark Angels]] [[3rd Company (Dark Angels)|3rd Company]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
[[Image:FarrenArt.jpg|thumb|right|230px|Lieutenant {{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1i}}]]
Leading a squad of newly inducted [[Primaris Space Marine]]s, Farren was assigned to destroy [[Tau]] forces on the [[Ocean World]] of [[Saltire Vex]].  During the battle against [[Tau]] [[Battlesuit]]s, Farren was subjected too psychic attack by [[Human]]s on an ocean rig and observed a strange black aircraft leaving the planet.{{Fn|1a}} An investigation led by the [[Chaplain]] [[Zaeroph]] and [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Gabrael]] revealed that the Humans on Saltire Vex were working with the Tau willingly as they feel the [[Imperium]] abandoned them. They also learn that the Tau are abducting people with [[Psyker|psychic]] potential, though they are likely not the source of the black aircraft. Intrigued, the Dark Angels condemned Jensa as a [[Heretic]], but decided to use the captured Human Psyker [[Jensa Deel]] as bait to lure the craft back.{{Fn|1a}} 

However before the plan could be put into action, Farren secretly met with Jensa and learned of her peoples plight. He then let her escape while giving her a scroll to present to the [[Astropathic Relay Station]] of [[Qaru Non]], hoping to secure help. In the ensuing escape, Farren's wounds from his earlier battle reopened, and he was forced to activate his [[Belisarian Furnace]] to make it to his [[Repulsor]] carrier.{{Fn|1b}} Upon waking back up in the care of [[Apothecary|Apothecaries]] on the [[Battle Barge]] ''[[Executioner's Blade]]'', Farren learned that his Primaris brothers have been subjected to similar strange psychic experiences and that the Dark Angels have promptly abandoned the Saltire Vex warzone in search for a new foe, later revealed to be the [[Fallen Angel]] [[Gohorael]], who is behind the mysterious black aircraft. Farren and the rest of his Primaris brethren were by this point still ignorant of the nature of the Fallen.{{Fn|1c}}{{Fn|1d}}

The Dark Angels then made for the [[Angels of Absolution]] homeworld of [[Allhallow]], which was under attack by Gohorael, who used his psychic abilities to transform the guards of their [[Fortress-Monastery]] into [[Mutant]] slaves.{{Fn|1d}}  The Dark Angels, led by a [[Deathwing]] contingent, arrived to find Tau forces under [[Commander Surestrike]] and [[Shas'O Monat Kais]] were also present on Allhallow and are purging the corrupted Humans. The Tau proposed a temporary alliance in order to confront their mutual enemy, and the Dark Angels reluctantly agreed in order to save Allhallow.{{Fn|1e}} 

Farren and his squad then descended into the lowest levels of the Angels of Absolutions Fortress-Monastery of [[Soul's Well]], and as they fought through hordes of Mutants and [[Daemon]]s learned that the target they were seeking was a fellow [[Space Marine]]. Farren, together with Sergeant [[Moricani]], were able to track down Ghorael and throw him from the battlements.{{Fn|1f}} After the battle, the Primaris Dark Angels learned that they are to be mind-warped to ostensibly erase their contact with the Tau, but in truth this is to hide the existence of the Fallen. They also learn that as part of the pact with the Tau, the Dark Angels are going to return to Saltire Vex to purge its human population in order to contain the psychic plague. Shaken to the core, Farren and the other Primaris veterans escape from the Apothecarian before they could be mind-wiped.{{Fn|1g}}

The Primaris Marines flee in a [[Boarding Torpedo]] and learned that the Dark Angels are attacking a [[Kroot Warsphere]] containing human refugees from Saltire Vex. Farren and his squad boarded the vessel and reunite with Jensa, who pleads with him to let her people go. Farren was then met by Master Garbael and Chaplain Zaeroph, who were unimpressed with his ruthlessness. They then revealed that the Primaris Marines would nonetheless be incorporated into the outer layer of the [[Inner Circle]] and will serve as spies to hunt the Fallen within the [[Ultima Founding]] and [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] for the secret brotherhood.{{Fn|1h}}

