'''Xhofar Beruddin''' was the [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Sons of Horus]]'s [[5th Company (Sons of Horus)|5th Company]], near the end of the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
This occurred during the [[Horus Heresy|Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]], following the debacle at the [[Saturnine Wall]] that saw the deaths of much of the [[Sons of Horus]]' leadership. This included the [[5th Company (Sons of Horus)|5th Company]]'s previous [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]], [[Horus Aximand]], who Beruddin replaced. However he was considered to be a poor copy of his predecessor.{{Fn|1}}

Later during the final stages of the [[Siege of Terra|Siege]], Beruddin drove deep into the '''Delphic Battlement''' of the [[Inner Palace]] and engaged with the [[White Scars]]' forces. He politely ignored [[Abaddon]]'s summons to return to him at once and make for their flagship, the ''[[Vengeful Spirit]]'', after its [[Void Shields]] were lowered. Beruddin instead continued fighting and urged the [[First Captain]] to join him in the [[Traitors]]' final victory over the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|2}} After the death of [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]], however, Beruddin and the [[5th Company (Sons of Horus)|5th Company]] retreated back into orbit and rallied around the ''Vengeful Spirit'', which was now under Abaddon's command.{{Fn|3}}

