Xicarius (Primaris Lieutenant).wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
''' Xicarius''' is a [[Primaris Space Marine|Primaris]] [[Vanguard Space Marine|Vanguard]] [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] in the [[Imperial Fists]]' [[10th Company (Imperial Fists)|10th Company]] and he is considered to be among the heroes of his [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}  
==History==
[[Image:Xicarius.jpg|thumb|right|220px|Xicarius{{Fn|1}}]]
He was born under a different name, at the [[Heptulla]] shrine station, where he was chosen as an [[Aspirant]] for the [[Imperial Fists]], by the [[Chaplain]] [[Xicarius (Chaplain)|Xicarius]]. When the time came for him to select an '''Oath Name''', he would chose Xicarius to honor the Chaplain, who been killed in the [[Battle of Nessus V]]. Afterwards, Xicarius became noted by his superiors for his keen mind for complex application of combat doctrines and skill in small-unit tactics. This led him to become a [[Scout Sergeant]], who led squads of [[Neophytes]], before Xicarius later [[Rubicon Primaris|joined]] the [[10th Company (Imperial Fists)|10th Company]]'s elite [[Vanguard Space Marine|Vanguard]] forces. He now holds the rank of [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] and has become an expert in combining his Chapter's siegecraft with the use of infiltration and indirect warfare. Currently Xicarius has been attached to a series of warzones under both [[Adepta Sororitas]] and [[Space Marine]] command. The Lieutenant has met every battle with careful deliberation and meticulous preparation, before unleashing swift and brutal force against his foes.{{Fn|1}} 

