Xolazi Imhele.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''Xolazi Imhele''' is an [[Ordo Astartes]] [[Inquisitor]], who is investigating the forces of the [[Wardens of the Gauntlet]], to determine if they are attempting to form a [[Space Marine Legion]].{{fn|1}}
==History==
She has dispatched her [[Sage|Inkhorn-Sage]] [[Sebikos Edjo]] to the [[Nachmund Gauntlet]] to investigate the matter, along with a larger number of servants to aid him. Edjo has since begun compiling a list of [[Chapter]]s serving in the [[Wardens of the Gauntlet|Wardens]] and sends Imhele weekly status reports. But his list is nowhere near to being completed, nor has Sage determined the exact makeup of each Chapters' forces in the Gauntlet. This is due to the combat losses the Wardens have suffered, along with the fact that new detachments from Chapters join them every cycle. Due to the difficulty of conducting the task in an active war zone, and that his servants have also suffered losses, Edjo has recently requested that [[Inquisitor]] Imhele send him additional resources. The Savant has sworn, though, that if there is even a hint that the Wardens are forming a [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], he will find it. His research so far, however, has led him to believe that [[Lord Commander]] [[Guilliman]] himself, has had a hand in the Wardens' creation. As brilliant as a strategist as he is, Edjo is sure Guilliman knew that such a group would be formed after he charged the [[Castellans of the Rift]] with defending the Nachmund Gauntlet. Such a difficult task, would have left the overburdened Castellans no choice but to call on other Chapters to aid them.{{fn|1}}

