Yas'anna.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Yas'anna''' was an [[Asuryani]] [[Farseer]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
She was among{{Fn|1}} the species' forces that invaded the [[Imperium]]'s [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the invading [[Asuryani]]{{Fn|2}} and Yas'anna was made one of its priority targets. The [[Farseer]] was one of the [[Xenos]]' leaders during the conflict and the Imperium believed Yas'anna was responsible for the raids on [[Xenith Secundus]]. These attacks destroyed several [[Colony World|colonies]] and the Imperium vowed vengeance against her. The Farseer was later captured by Imperial forces during the Campaign and was held for probing. Once the Imperium was finished with Yas'anna, the Farseer was executed.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
{{Trivia}}
''Yas'anna'' and [[Xenith Secundus]] were created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]] by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Franklin Mills''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

