Yored Massak.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Codicier]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] at the time of the [[Council of Nikaea]].{{Fn|1}}

When the [[Edict of Nikaea]] was delivered, he and the rest of the Legion's [[Librarian|Librarius]] were sealed in a vault deep within ''[[Phalanx]]''. After the outbreak of the [[Horus Heresy]], [[Nathaniel Garro]] infiltrated ''Phalanx'' and offered to free Massak if he would join [[Malcador (Character)|Malcador]]'s [[Knights-Errant]]. Secluded in the vault, Massak had not known of [[Horus]]' betrayal until Garro came, but still refused to eave except by the order of [[Rogal Dorn]]. Dorn insisted that the Librarians were precisely where they needed to be, standing ready until he chose the right moment.{{fn|1}}

Massak's moment came during the [[Solar War]] when ''[[The Phalanx]]'' was assailed by the [[Daemon]]ic hordes of [[Samus]]. During the fighting, Dorn authorized the unleashing of his Librarians and Massak and his comrades helped save the Primarch's life.{{Fn|2}}

