Yosharo DuGal.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Yosharo DuGal''' is the current [[Chapter Master]] of the [[Void Talons]].{{Fn|1a}}

==History==
He is among the [[Chapter]]'s forces taking part in [[Indomitus Crusade Fleet Quartus]] and personally leads the [[Void Talons]] within [[Battle Group Forthrax]]. While it was initially command by [[Groupmaster]] [[Kelmer]], this ended after the bellicose [[nobleman]] refused to listen to his advisors and ordered a full-scale attack into the [[Chaos]]-held [[Stygion System]]. This allowed the Battle Group to fall victim to [[Kelmer's Folly|an ambush]] by the [[Alpha Legion]] and [[Night Lords]], who inflicted heavy causalities on Forthrax's forces. Kelmer was among those who were killed and DuGal took command of the Battle Group's remnants afterwards. While the [[Chapter Master]] was able to lead them out of the System, over a third of Forthrax's strength was lost to the [[Traitor Legion]]s.{{Fn|1a}}

DuGal took command of Forthrax's forces during the [[Battle of Malak]], though it is unknown if he survived the battle.{{Fn|1b}}

