'''Yssarile''' was a [[Daemon Prince|daemon-king]] who attempted to usurp [[Tzeentch]].{{fn|1}}

The ''[[Malus Codicium]]'' tells the tale of '''Yssarile''', a lieutenant, warlord, or prince of one of the four [[Chaos Gods|primary powers]] of [[Chaos]] in a time when there were only three. The daemon-king attempted to usurp his master, a [[Tzeentch|foul sorcerer]], in a war of bitter enmity said to have lasted for a billion years. Eventually, Yssarile was defeated - [[True Death|killed outright]] by his former master.{{fn|1}}

Their king dead, his host fled in terror to seek sanctuary in the material universe. There, they established a capital, [[Ghül]], and six kindred colonies. Ghül itself is said to have been built upon the daemon-king's mausoleum, itself constructed around his barque.{{fn|1}}

