'''Yukor''' was an elderly [[Dark Eldar]] [[Haemonculus]].{{Fn|1a}}

Wishing to train the a new generation of fighters for the [[Wych Cult|Wych arenas]], Yukor oversaw a cruel and brutal training regimen for many female Dark Eldar youth. Among these were [[Lelith Hesperax]] and [[Morghana Nathrax]], both of whom would go on to become successful [[Succubus|Succubi]]. Despite their successes, neither of the Wyches have any fondness for Yukor or the agony of what he put them through.{{Fn|1a}}

Some time later Yukor was assassinated by [[Rhudraex]], another one of the Wych fighters he had trained. The Wych had to kill him three times before he stayed dead. Rhudraex herself was killed shortly after.{{Fn|1b}}

