Yulla Kassine.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Yulla Kassine''' was an [[Adepta Sororitas]], who took part in the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
In the later years of the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade|Crusade]], Kassine became a part of the reincarnated [[Imperial Saint]] [[Saint Sabbat|Sabbat]]'s retinue. The [[Adepta Sororitas]] was a true believer in Saint Sabbat's status as a [[Living Saint]] and was always by her side. This led Kassine into joining the Saint, as both her and [[Warmaster]] [[Macaroth]]'s forces fought to reclaim [[Urdesh]] from the [[Sons of Sek]]. However Macaroth eventually turned Saint Sabbat into a figurehead for the Crusade. The Saint was then kept away in a secret location, but it was discovered by the Sons of Sek, who attempted to kill her. They were stopped by the [[Iron Snakes]] [[Chapter]], before they reached the Saint, but the attack resulted in [[Imperials]] being killed. This quickly spurred Saint Sabbat into taking a more direct role in the battles against the Sons. While the Saint's retinue members, [[Brey Auerben]] and [[Iovin Mazho]] tried to dissuade her from this, Saint Sabbat remained firm in her decision.{{Fn|1b}}

