Zadkiel (Daemon Prince).wikitext:
{{TzeentchPortal}}
'''Zadkiel''' is a [[Daemon Prince]] of [[Tzeentch]].{{Fn|1a}}

The [[Blood Angels]] [[Librarian]] [[Mephiston]] believes Zadkiel to be a particularly dangerous [[Daemon]], intended to become the herald of a new [[Tzeentch]]ian empire in the [[Materium]]. Mephiston sees the Daemon as an immense threat should his plans be allowed to succeed, and now hunts him across the [[Galaxy]].{{Fn|1a}}

Zadkiel has been summoned to [[Prospero]] by [[Magnus]] and manipulated the [[Thousand Sons]] Magister [[Lyræ]] to his own ends.{{Fn|1b}} He intended to summon [[Silver Tower]]s on [[Terra]] to accelerate mutation and enhance the growth of [[Psyker]]s on Humanity's throneworld.{{Fn|1c}} However, due to the efforts of Mephiston, Zadkiel bungled the summoning ritual, sending the Silver Towers back into the [[Labyrinth of Tzeentch]]. In a rage, [[Magnus]] banished him to the Warp for an eternity of torment.{{Fn|1d}}

