'''Zaia Thrull''' is a displaced [[Forge Mistress]], who commands the [[Mars Sub-sector Theta-nine Containment Force]].{{Fn|1}}


==History==
They are the last remaining defenders of a fateful, long-abandoned Forge City in the middle of the Sub-sector, which is carefully watched over.{{Fn|2}} The [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] contingent is far removed from their traditional Forges, though, and as a result they have limited resources for their personal maintenance. However, Thrull and the Containment Force use the majority of their sparse resources and time to lovingly maintain their pristine high quality weapons.{{Fn|1}} 

They do not know, though, that a band of opportunists, who jealously covet the secrets hidden within the Forge City, are now approaching it.{{Fn|2}} 

