{{BlackLegionPortal}}
'''Zaraphiston''' is a [[Black Legion]] [[Sorcerer]] and the most senior advisor to [[Abaddon the Despoiler]]. Originally of the [[Thousand Sons]], at the behest of [[Tzeentch]] himself he traveled deep into the [[Eye of Terror]]. On a [[Daemon World]] of brass cogs and ticking chronometers, Zaraphiston was gifted with a terrible understanding of the future. Thereafter, he joined the Black Legion and pledged himself to Abaddon.{{Fn|3}}

