{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Zennet''' was a [[Sharpshooter]] of the [[Hyrkan Eighth]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]], active during the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

He was amongst those Hyrkans deployed on [[Formal Prime]] during [[Operation Redrake|the first major phase]] of the Crusade. While on Formal Prime, his squad was sent ahead of [[Imperial]] lines to the [[Underhive|underlayers]] of [[Sangrel Hive]] to assist a survey team lead by [[Wal Desruisseaux]] which had uncovered a shrine to [[Saint Sabbat]]. However, the "shrine" turned out to be a prison containing something that would aid the forces of [[Chaos]] in the region and Desruisseaux was actually a [[Charismites|Charismite]] [[Chaos cultist]]. Desruisseaux tried to kill the Guardsmen so he could use their equipment to unseal the prison, but Zennet killed him in the ensuing firefight after [[Commissar]] [[Ibram Gaunt]] drove him out of cover with his [[bolt pistol]].{{Fn|1}}

