Zenobi Adedeji.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Zenobi Adedeji''' was a volunteer of the [[Addaba Free Corps]] [[PDF]] [[Regiment]] and standard-bearer for the 64th Defence Corps in the [[Battle of Terra]], during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Adedeji was a line worker in the great factories of the [[Addaba Hive]]. Her family had once been of the Ruby Royalty within the hive, but had fallen from grace when they resisted the Emperor during the [[Unification Wars]]. Forced into the role of the lowest workers of the hive thanks to her ancestors, she lived a meager life. When the Addaba Free Corps sought volunteers she volunteered for military duty.{{Fn|1}}

Adedeji joined with her cousin [[Menber Adedeji|Menber]] and together they traveled from the hive towards the [[Lion's Gate Spaceport]]. During this journey, Adedeji was approached by followers of the [[Lectitio Divinitatus]] in an attempt to recruit her. Instead she reported them to the corps' integrity officers. This lead to a widespread purge of the imperial faithful from the corps' ranks.

Eventually [[Rogal Dorn]] ordered the Addaba Free Corps to reinforce the space port, upon which the 64th Defence Corpse revealed themselves to be traitors that had sided with the [[Horus Lupercal|Warmaster]]. They attacked the other loyalist troops meant to reinforce the Space Port. These actions caused the fall of the Space port to the [[Iron Warriors]].{{Fn|1}}

