Zerberyn.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Fists Exemplar]] during the [[War of the Beast]].{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
Acting as [[First Captain]] of the [[Chapter]] aboard the [[Battle Barge]] ''[[Dantalion]]'', during the war he was forced to align himself with [[Warsmith]] [[Kalkator]] in order to fend off a massive [[Ork]] fleet. Upon meeting up with [[Tempestus Scion]]s who attempted to fire on his reluctant [[Iron Warriors]] allies, Zerberyn was forced to kill his [[Human]] allies, seemingly condemning himself further to damnation.{{Fn|1}}

He was later seen in the [[Immitis System]] fighting Ork forces alongside the Iron Warriors. After his confidant [[Mandek]] died, Zerberyn began to lose his last remaining doubts over the heresy of their actions.{{Fn|2}} Zerberyn next appeared alongside his Iron Warriors allies in an attempt to acquire an [[Astropath]]ic station. After the [[Inquisition]] discovered they were working alongside [[Chaos Space Marine]]s, a battle broke out.{{Fn|3}}

When he learned that The Beast had been defeated, Zerberyn rendezvous with his [[Black Templar]] allies and attempted to explain that the Iron Warriors of Kalkator be allowed to leave in peace due to their contributions to the war effort. However the Black Templars led by [[High Marshal (Black Templars)|High Marshal]] [[Bohemond]] would have none of it, and many of his own Fists Exemplar brethren rebelled as well at the prospect of opposing the Imperium. In a subsequent battle with the Black Templars, Zerberyn was faced with killing either Bohemond or Kalkator and ultimately chose the former. With no other choice left, he kneeled before Kalkator and pledged himself to the Iron Warriors.{{Fn|4}}

