{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Zeriah''' (also known as '''Elucidax the Keeper''') was a [[Fallen Angel]], formerly a [[Dark Angels]] Captain of the 14th Assault Company.{{Fn|1}}

After the [[Horus Heresy]], [[Luther]] and a force of Dark Angels rebelled against the [[Imperium]] and [[Lion El'Jonson]]. Zeriah was one of the rebels but he escaped with the destruction of [[Caliban]].{{Fn|1}}

