Zhas'el Aun'Mor.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Zhas'el Aun'Mor''' was an [[Ethereal]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} its [[Third Sphere of Expansion]] forces{{Fn|2}} that invaded the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|3}} During the course of the [[Xenos]]' invasions, Aun'mor was able to convince many Imperial worlds to join the [[T'au Empire]]. However the [[Ethereal]] ordered that those worlds who refused his offer, had the T'au's flashing [[Star Blade]] weapons unleashed upon them.{{Fn|1}} The Imperium later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]] against the invading Xenos{{Fn|3}} and the [[Ethereal]] was made a priority target. The Imperium wanted Aun'Mor dead for his actions and the Ethereal was later killed, during one of the Campaign's battles.{{Fn|1}} 
