'''Zheena''' is a [[Marchioness]] in the [[Imperial Knight]] [[Knight House|House]] [[House Jerrod|Jerrod]].{{Fn|1}}

She is serving in [[Herald (Knight)|Herald-Magnus]] [[Hesther Jerrodene]]'s lance, which is fighting besides a [[Astra Militarum]] [[General]]'s [[Guardsmen]]. However, the laggard Guardsman were unable to keep up with the lance, which led to a confrontation between Jerrodene and the General. When it was suggested they wait for the Guardsmen, the Herald-Magnus refused. Jerrodene stated that [[House Jerrod]] were the greatest warriors in the [[Sub-sector]] they were fighting in and her lance consisted of the House's best [[Knight]]s. She then listed some of the lance's personal accomplishments, such as Zheena holding [[Fulgurite Bastion]] alone, against the [[Red Templar]]. It was because of her lance's superior skills, that Jerrodene refused to wait for the General's Guardsmen.{{Fn|1}}

