Zhorisch.wikitext:
{{IronWarriorsPortal}}
'''Zhorisch''' is a [[Warsmith]] of the [[Iron Warriors]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
An ancient warrior of the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] and native of [[Olympia]], Zhorisch initially proved himself a capable leader during the [[Great Crusade]] while serving the [[Emperor]]. Fanatically loyal to [[Perturabo]], he gleefully followed his Legion into bitterness and treachery in the [[Horus Heresy]]. He went on to serve with distinction in the [[Drop Site Massacre]], the sieges of [[Yarant]] and [[Vanaheim]], and the [[Iron Cage]].{{Fn|1}}

Over the millennia since the Heresy, he rose to the rank of Warsmith and gained command over a powerful warband through guile and cunning. As Warsmith, he developed a well-known lust for hidden knowledge, leading many campaigns of terror against unsuspecting [[Imperial]] worlds in pursuit of both academic and technological secrets.{{Fn|1}}

He went on to assault the [[Obsidian Forge]] on the [[Forge World]] of [[Imbru]], looking to loot its technological treasures. In the aftermath of the invasion, he found all that he was looking for and more, including an ancient [[xenos]] artefact known as the [[Javar Gate]]. Now, after centuries of experimentation, the Javar Gate has finally been activated, much to the delight of the Warsmith.{{Fn|1}}

