Zhoron.wikitext:
{{SonsOfHorusPortal}}
'''Zhoron''' was a [[Sons of Horus]] [[Chaos Apothecary|Apothecary]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]] and after the [[Traitors]] were [[Siege of Terra|defeated]], he joined the [[Vaithan Reaver Squad]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
The [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]'s end came soon afterwards within the [[Eye of Terror]], however, when the other [[Traitor Legions]] began attacking the [[Sons of Horus]] for the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra|failure]]. The [[Vaithan Reaver Squad]] were shattered in one such attack, by the [[Thousand Sons]] forces of the [[Sorcerer]] [[Kahotep]]. This led to the defenses of the Squad's stronghold within the Eye to be breached and led their [[Chaos Lord|Captain]], [[Erekan Juric]], to give the order for his Warband to evacuate aboard their [[Thunderhawk]]s. The Squad's surviving members began to do so, but Zhoron lost his legs in Kahotep's attack and had to be carried to a Thunderhawk by Juric. Once the [[Chaos Apothecary|Apothecary]] was aboard, though, the Captain refused to join him, despite Zhoron pleading with Juric to escape with them while there was still a chance to do so. The Captain would not change his mind, however, as he sought to gain revenge for the Vaithan Reaver Squad by killing Kahotep. The Thunderhawk carrying Zhoron would then evacuate from the Warband's besieged base and Juric was killed by the Thousand Sons Sorcerer, soon afterwards.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[Extinction (Short Story)]]

