Zhrukal Androcles.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the Captain of the [[Star Phantoms]] 9th Company. He is known as the 'Siegebreaker'.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Regarded as a grim and relentless warrior, Zhrukhal made his name battling [[Sentrek Freemen]] [[Traitor Guard]] as a [[Devastator Squad|Devastator]] [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]]. During this engagement his squad scored 58 tank kills in a single day's fighting. Later during the [[Battle of Orsha]], Androles breached and captured the Renegade's [[Leviathan (Transport)|Leviathan]]. Following these accomplishments he was swiftly promoted to Captain of the 9th Company.{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Badab War]], Zhrukal led the Star Phantoms contingent against the Palace of Thorns on [[Badab Primaris]]. In the climatic final battle Zhrukhal's forces encountered [[Lugft Huron]] and his entourage and were wiped out to a man, but not before the dying Captain grievously injured the Tyrant of Badab.{{Fn|1}}

