Zhukel Dror.wikitext:
{{KhornePortal}}{{WorldEatersPortal}}
[[Image:RedButcherArt.jpg|thumb|right|180px|Zhukel Dror as a [[Red Butcher]]{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Zhukel Dror''' was a [[World Eaters]] [[Red Butcher]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He originally served with the [[Traitor Legion|Legion]]'s [[8th Company (World Eaters)|8th Company]] in the [[Great Crusade]], however, he was marked for death for being deemed too [[Loyalist|loyal]] to the [[Imperium]], when the [[Horus Heresy]] began. During the subsequent [[Battle of Isstvan III]], Dror was severely wounded fighting against the [[Traitor]]s, but was later found alive by them in the battle's aftermath. He was left so broken in mind by the experience though, that Dror could no longer tell friend from foe and he was soon shipped to [[Bodt]] along with hundreds of similarly wounded [[Legionary|Legionaries]]. Once there, he was induced into the ranks of the [[World Eaters]]' [[Red Butchers]] and was among the Traitor Legion's forces that defended Bodt's capital, '''Tredecimmia''', when the world was [[Battle of Bodt|invaded]] by the [[Imperium]]. Dror ultimately killed at least a dozen Loyalist Legionaries and twice that number of [[Solar Auxilia]] fighting in the capital, before he was crushed to death by an [[Iron Hands]] [[Mastodon (Vehicle)|Mastodon]].{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
