Zvarin Roist.wikitext:
{{BlackTemplarsPortal}}
'''Zvarin Roist''' is a [[Castellan (Black Templars)|Castellan]] of the [[Black Templars]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

Roist is the Castellan of the [[Elysium Crusade]], which consists of Templars sent to aid the rebuilding of the [[Third War of Armageddon|decimated]] [[Celestial Lions]] Chapter on their [[Adeptus Astartes Homeworld|homeworld]], [[Elysium IX]]. However, following the creation of the [[Great Rift]], Elysium became one of the many worlds of [[Elara's Veil]] threatened by the invasion of a [[Chaos]] Warhost known as the [[Exilarchy]]. The Rift has also stranded the [[Imperial]] forces located in the Veil, but this has not caused Roist and his Templars to forswear their oaths to the Celestial Lions. They continue to aid in the rebuilding of their Brother Chapter and aid the Lions in defending the Veil from the Chaos invaders.{{Fn|1}}

